- P18-V01 Fastjson `WriteNameAsSymbol` mapping (code commit `4d07ad5a`,
  2026-10-17): pinned RocketMQ 5.5.1 `RemotingSerializable.encode(Feature...)`
  calls Fastjson2 `JSON.toJSONBytes` with UTF-8; Fastjson 2.0.63 implements
  symbol emission in JSONB type-name paths, so this UTF-8 text JSON feature is
  output-preserving. Existing invoked Java feature fixtures cover mapped body
  DTOs, both route DTOs, and HeartbeatData. Rust now accepts the feature and
  compares its output with the Java baseline in those fixture tests. No fixture
  or Java oracle source change was needed.
- Validation on `4d07ad5a`: `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-protocol
